# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Required Environment Variables for Dev Journal
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Supabase Authentication & Database
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard → Project Settings → API
# - VITE_SUPABASE_URL: Your Supabase project URL (e.g., https://xxxx.supabase.co)
# - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: Your Supabase anonymous/public API key
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_project_url
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key

# Groq API for AI Insights
# Get this from: https://console.groq.com/keys
# Used for generating AI-powered insights from journal entries
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Instructions
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local (never commit .env.local to version control)
# 2. Fill in each variable with your actual API keys and URLs
# 3. The app will not start without these variables configured
# 4. See README.md for detailed setup instructions
